# What is said at the things they do together: dice, the flask, a story, the
# watch changing, the captain's round, waking the sleeper, feeding the fire.

== round_tam
place: round
cast: A = captain; B = name(Tam)
cooldown: once
A [kicks]: On your feet. The Moon-Glass doesn't guard itself.
B: I was listening, Captain. With my eyes shut.

# Asking the others first (played by the gathering itself, never chosen).

== invite_dice
place: invite
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 0s
again: yes
A: Dice?
B: Go on, then.

== invite_flask
place: invite
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 0s
again: yes
A [nods]: Something to keep the cold out?
B: I thought you'd never ask.

== invite_story
place: invite
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 0s
again: yes
A: Sit down, you lot. I'll tell you one.
B: Not the one about the eel-wife.

# Dice at the crate by the bench.

== dice_cold_hands
place: dice
group: dice
cast: A = any; B = any; C? = any
cooldown: 10m
A [throws]: Come on, come on...
B [laughs]: Two ones. The dog's eyes.
A: My hands are too cold to throw.
C: They were warm enough for the pie.
B: Throw again, then. I'll wait.

== dice_col_wins
place: dice
group: dice
cast: A = lucky; B = any; C? = any
cooldown: 10m
A [throws]: Sixes. Both of them.
B: Again? Let me see those bones.
A [shrugs]: Same bones as yours.
C [laughs]: Nobody's luck lasts like {A}'s.
B {if craven}: I'm not betting the rest. Not against him.
B: One more. Double or nothing.

== dice_debt
place: dice
group: dice
cast: A = any; B = owes(A); C? = any
cooldown: 10m
A: You still owe me four pennies for the dice.
B: Three. I won the last throw.
A: You knocked the cup over. That's not winning, that's clumsy.
B [shrugs]: It's a kind of winning.
C [laughs]: Pay the man, {B}.

# The flask, passed between two.

== flask_brother
place: flask
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 5m
A: Here. Against the cold.
B [drinks]: Gods, what is that?
A: My brother-in-law makes it.
B: Tell him to stop.
A [laughs]: Give it back, then.

== flask_just_one
place: flask
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 5m
A [drinks]: Want some?
B: If the captain smells it on me...
A: She'll smell the cold on you first.
B [drinks]: Just the one.
A: That's what you said last night.

# A story round the fire.

== story_sewer_thing
place: story
cast: A = storyteller|rank>=2; B = any; C? = any; D? = any
cooldown: once
A: When I caught rats in the Undertown, we had a saying.
B: Don't fall in?
A: Don't count the eyes.
C: What eyes?
A [points:the well]: Down there, a lantern shows you eyes. Rats. Hundreds.
A: One night I counted. And one pair didn't blink.
D {if craven}: {A}, stop it.
B: What was it?
A [shrugs]: Never found out. I stopped counting.
C [laughs]: He stopped catching rats, too.
A [laughs]: That I did.

== story_captain_hask
place: story
cast: A = storyteller|rank>=2; B = any; C? = any; D? = any
cooldown: once
A: Before this captain we had old Hask. You remember Hask?
B: Only the stories.
A: He slept in his armour. Said a man should be ready.
C: Was he?
A: The night the Low Bridge burned, he stood up so fast he fell down the stairs.
B [laughs]: In his armour?
A: Rolled all the way to the gate. Loudest thing that night.
D: What happened to him?
A [shrugs]: A farm, out past the walls. Wears the armour to the privy, I hear.
C [laughs]: Ready for anything.

== story_drowned_lantern
place: story
cast: A = storyteller|rank>=2; B = any; C? = any; D? = any
cooldown: once
A: You know why they call it the Drowned Lantern?
B: Because the beer's water?
A [laughs]: Besides that. Forty years back, the canal rose in one night.
A: The keeper stayed at his post with the lantern, for the boats.
C: And drowned?
A: They found the lantern still burning on the roof. Never found him.
B [whispers]: They say it's still lit, some nights.
A: They say you owe me a drink for the story, too.
D [laughs]: Now that's a ghost story.

# The watch changing: A the man on the post, B his relief.

== watch_anything
place: watch_change
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 0s
again: yes
B: Anything?
A: Nothing but the cold.
B [nods]: Off you go, then.

== watch_feet
place: watch_change
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 0s
again: yes
B: Your turn's up.
A: About time. I can't feel my feet.
B: Anything I should know?
A [shrugs]: A cat on the wall. Twice.

== watch_orders
place: watch_change
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 0s
again: yes
B: Relief. Captain's orders.
A: She can have my feet as well. They're no use to me.
B [laughs]: Go and get warm.

== watch_dark
place: watch_change
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 0s
again: yes
A [whispers]: Keep an eye on the dark behind the store.
B: Why? What's there?
A: Nothing. That's what I don't like.

# The captain's round: A the captain, B the man she stops at.

== round_tam_boot
place: round
cast: A = captain; B = name(Tam)
cooldown: once
priority: 5
A [kicks]: Up. You'll sleep when you're dead, and sooner if I catch you again.
B: Captain. I was resting my eyes.

== round_osric
place: round
priority: 1
cast: A = captain; B = name(Osric)
cooldown: once
A: Keep your brother off the dice tonight.
B [nods]: I'll try, Captain.

== round_jory
place: round
priority: 1
cast: A = captain; B = name(Jory)
cooldown: once
A: You're daydreaming again. The Lantern will keep.
B: Yes, Captain.

== round_brand
place: round
priority: 1
cast: A = captain; B = name(Brand)
cooldown: once
A: Chop the wood, Brand. Not the block.
B [laughs]: The block started it.

== round_wat
place: round
priority: 1
cast: A = captain; B = name(Wat)
cooldown: once
A: Eyes on the water, Wat. Not on the storehouse.
B [shrugs]: Can't I do both?

== round_aldous
place: round
priority: 1
cast: A = captain; B = name(Aldous)
cooldown: once
A: How are the knees tonight?
B: Older than you, Captain. Like the rest of me.

== round_hendrik
place: round
priority: 1
cast: A = captain; B = name(Hendrik)
cooldown: once
A: How's your girl?
B [sighs]: Better, they say. Thank you for asking.

== round_piers
place: round
priority: 1
cast: A = captain; B = name(Piers)
cooldown: once
A: Sit up straight. You look like a sack of turnips.
B: I feel like one, Captain.

== round_col
place: round
priority: 1
cast: A = captain; B = name(Col)
cooldown: once
A: Is that your second supper?
B: Third, Captain. The cook likes me.

== round_gideon
place: round
priority: 1
cast: A = captain; B = name(Gideon)
cooldown: once
A: The ledger balance yet?
B: It would, if the lamp oil stayed where I put it.

== round_ned
place: round
priority: 1
cast: A = captain; B = name(Ned)
cooldown: once
A: Two weeks, Ned. You'll do.
B [nods]: Thank you, Captain.

== round_steady
place: round
cast: A = captain; B = steady
cooldown: 0s
again: yes
A: All quiet?
B [nods]: All quiet, Captain.

== round_steady_cold
place: round
cast: A = captain; B = steady
cooldown: 0s
again: yes
A: Keep moving. The cold gets in if you stand.
B: Aye, Captain.

== round_rash
place: round
cast: A = captain; B = rash
cooldown: 0s
again: yes
A: Easy. Save it for someone who deserves it.
B: If anyone comes, they'll get it.

== round_craven
place: round
cast: A = captain; B = craven
cooldown: 0s
again: yes
A: Stop jumping at shadows.
B: They jump first, Captain.

== round_stubborn
place: round
cast: A = captain; B = stubborn
cooldown: 0s
again: yes
A: Still standing?
B: Till I'm told otherwise.

== round_sly
place: round
cast: A = captain; B = sly
cooldown: 0s
again: yes
A: Whatever you're thinking, don't.
B [shrugs]: Thinking's free, Captain.

# Waking the sleeper: A the man who wakes him, B the sleeper.

== wake_turn
place: wake
cast: A = any; B = any
cooldown: 0s
again: yes
A: Up. It's your turn.
B: Five more minutes.
A: You've had five hours.
B [sighs]: Coming, coming.

== wake_tam
place: wake
cast: A = any; B = name(Tam)
cooldown: once
A: Tam. Tam! The watch.
B: I wasn't asleep. I was thinking.
A: With your mouth open?
B: I think better that way.

# The fire fed: A the man who fed it, B anyone near.

== fire_till_dawn
place: fire
cast: A = any; B? = any
cooldown: 0s
again: yes
A: There. That'll keep till dawn.
B: It'll keep till you turn your back.

== fire_wet_wood
place: fire
cast: A = any; B? = any
cooldown: 0s
again: yes
A [sighs]: The wood's wet again.
B: Then blow on it.
